WEBVTT

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:25.600
What the hell are you doing here, brat?

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:32.530
Are you the son of a Roland officer?

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:36.330
Or are you a pleasure child taken from an Estabul village?

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.100
What's your name?

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:42.180
Ryner Lute.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.110
Huh? I can't hear you.

00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:48.060
I'm Talrom.

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.150
This is how things are gonna be between us. Get it, Ryner Lute?

00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:56.570
If you wanna live, work as if your life depends on it.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:00.060
If you understand that, get to work. No standing around daydreaming.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.900
Or I'll kill you.

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:08.090
If I get touched by a wild beast, that's the end!

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:09.260
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:13.880
Ferris got it into your head that one touch from me could make you pregnant, right?

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.860
There's no way that could happen, so just relax.

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:22.780
Grabbing my younger sister's arm, and...

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:28.140
Abducting a young child, assaulting her, or impregnating her? Not on my life.

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.540
You know, I'm starting to become more afraid of myself,

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:35.650
for having an easier time guessing the expressions on your expressionless face.

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.940
My dear sister!

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:39.990
How nice of you to come, Iris.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:41.440
Nothing happened on your trip?

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:46.110
Nope! I missed you, so I came in a big hurry!

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:49.910
Isn't Iris... a good... girl?

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:50.920
Yes.

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:52.170
Hey, now!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:57.870
I merely put my adorable younger sister to sleep.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.550
You put her to sleep?

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:05.970
When I was a child, I often had my brother put me to sleep this way.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:08.350
What the hell kind of family are you?

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:10.560
Ah, here we are.

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:15.060
Dumplings are only at their best when they come from the Wynnit dumpling shop.

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:25.520
If you've got time to eat, take care of your little sister!

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:28.370
Are you gonna take responsibility for this girl's future?

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.250
Iris should have arrived safely by now.

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:37.300
I hope my message makes it in time.

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.570
Sister, this is delicious!

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:45.920
Ever since this morning, it's been nothing but "dumpling this, dumpling that."

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:48.210
Iris, what did you come here for?

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:52.490
Er, uhm, uhh...

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:54.760
Oh, yeah! A letter!

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:55.870
A letter?

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:58.480
Yeah, Iris got a letter!

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:02.730
Brother Sion said to bring it on a super express delivery!

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:07.060
He said it's a really important letter, so read it!

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:08.860
Sure, go ahead.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:11.600
Er, uhm...

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:15.760
It's important, so I put it someplace where I wouldn't lose it...

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:18.980
Aw, where is it?

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.170
Did you hear anything from Sion?

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:23.820
Um, let's see...

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:27.400
He said something about some dragon disappearing!

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:28.840
Dragon?

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:41.880
Oh, yes, that pointlessly dangerous dragon.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:45.030
He must want us to investigate the cause.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.430
What a pain.

00:05:46.430 --> 00:05:52.180
Uhm, er, I think he said something else important, but...

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:55.880
Don't worry about it. We'll figure it out once we get there.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:05:57.700
You're serious?

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.130
I suddenly feel the urge to go out investigating.

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:05.380
Iris, tell Sion we'll be going to investigate.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:06.840
Got it!

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.470
What's this?

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:24.110
Let's see. "About the incident you reported the other day,

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:26.970
where the dragon emerged from the surface..."

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:32.150
<i>Countless villagers living around that forest have been slaughtered,</i>

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:34.210
<i>and the dragon seems to have vanished.</i>

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:36.450
<i>Abandon all research concerning this relic.</i>

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:39.700
<i>Whatever you do, don't ever approach that forest again.</i>

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:52.050
It would be quite elegant to have some tea here.

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:54.630
Yeah, I like that idea.

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:57.970
Let's drop this stupid investigation right now and have some tea.

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:08.140
Don't tell me that dragon...

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:09.880
We'll investigate the cause.

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:16.700
Look.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.940
There's no blood.

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:25.060
So that's why there's no smell of blood with this many people dead.

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:26.170
Why would this...?

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:29.070
Over there.

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:32.800
Hey, you two over there!

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:35.850
Aren't you...

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:44.500
Aren't you guys that secret inspector duo from Nelpha?

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:48.320
My, what a pleasure. It's been quite some time.

00:07:48.890 --> 00:07:51.070
What are you doing here?

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.990
We came to see the rumoured dragon, of course.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:57.810
Seeing a dragon would really spur my writer's inspiration, you know!

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:01.850
A dragon suddenly appears and abducts the princess! And...

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:05.300
I hope you're not going to add some cliche development,

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:08.410
like a hero suddenly emerging to boldly face the dragon.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:12.210
That's why your writing never sells, brother!

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:15.140
So, what's all this?

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:17.510
We don't have a clue.

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:20.470
There's no blood from the bodies, either.

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:23.000
Ferris?

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:26.060
Perhaps you can explain this?

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:40.600
Oh dear, I guess you noticed?

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:42.660
Did you two kill them?

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:47.210
Our goal in visiting that fortress was the same as yours.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.160
Do you understand now?

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:51.250
You're also after hero relics?

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:57.760
So you guys tailed us, and found the relic. Is that about right?

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:02.250
Yes. Thanks to the cooperation from the Taboo Breaker Squadron,

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.650
it went quite well.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:09.480
Just as we had hoped, you two found the relic, and abandoned it for us to find.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:12.840
I'm grateful beyond words, I assure you.

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.070
Bullshit.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:21.400
You guys killed everyone who saw the dragon in order to silence them.

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:24.530
So that fewer people would know of the existence of the hero relics.

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:28.350
It's best if we're the only ones monopolizing unknown power.

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:31.880
So, we'll need you two to die as well.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.300
Who the hell are—

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.960
Who are you two?

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:39.260
Why are you gathering hero relics?

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:42.860
Oh, I see. You intend to survive this.

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:44.810
That's why you'd ask.

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.690
No, I suppose there's no need to ask.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:51.940
I'm already well aware of the country you two are affiliated with.

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:57.470
I offer up this contract, to bear the wicked spirit beast which sleeps in the earth!

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:02.580
Magic to increase your physical capabilities, is it?

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.650
How very fast. But...

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:08.690
From the direction of the west, the empty, the formation, the yang...!

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.170
Alpha Stigma?

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.870
...I bring forth brilliance!

00:10:11.870 --> 00:10:13.890
He stole it even when I stopped halfway through?

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:14.620
Kuu!

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:18.880
Wha—

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:25.580
Shit!

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:34.780
Come, now. Regardless of how much my beauty attracts you,

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:37.670
this is hardly an appropriate time for assaulting me.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:40.860
How can you act so calm and collected?

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:43.320
I'm always calm and collected.

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:45.370
How much so?

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.710
Enough to know that if you hadn't saved me,

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:50.710
that attack just now would have killed me.

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:59.180
That scythe is dangerous.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:01.050
Is that another hero relic?

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:07.110
Yeah. Looks like it raises its wielder's physical capabilities pretty damn high.

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:08.430
That, and...

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:13.340
So that scythe's power is what kept those bodies from bleeding,

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:15.960
and what made that wall of ice.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:19.220
A sword that gets frozen over from multiple clashes would quickly grow heavy.

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:21.220
It also lowers the surrounding temperature,

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:22.680
and makes it harder to move.

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:23.970
Okay.

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:27.020
I'll back you up with fire magic and create an opening.

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:28.960
You stop that scythe.

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.000
Sound good?

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.790
It'll have to do.

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:35.540
Well? Have you decided on your plan?

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.670
Yeah, more or less.

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:39.130
Excellent.

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:44.790
You have an Alpha Stigma. That's quite valuable, you know.

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:47.390
I'll be sure to be careful when I crystallize it and take it from you.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:48.880
Crystallize?

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:53.790
Oh, you bear an Alpha Stigma and don't know of that?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:57.440
I wouldn't ask if I knew!

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:05.820
<i>Does he know more about the Alpha Stigma than I do?</i>

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:09.700
They don't seem to know anything.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:17.850
I suppose that makes sense, given that they abandoned the Rule Fragment that was here.

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:19.500
Rule Fragment?

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.830
Then, allow me to show you...

00:12:21.830 --> 00:12:25.180
...how to use the relic you two abandoned!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.760
That's how relics are used?

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:55.670
The Dolueli Swordscale.

00:12:55.670 --> 00:13:00.210
It's a weapon that burns targets as the user wills it.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:03.210
The ground has no will of its own,

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:07.010
so when it emerged from the ground, it was completely harmless.

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:10.690
Now then, shall we get started?

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:15.550
We shall give you a full taste of the power of relics!

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:33.730
You must be quite calm to nap like this.

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:36.110
What I seek is thunder. Izuchi!

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:37.710
A waste of time!

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:45.550
Is that another hero relic?

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:49.750
Yes. Kuu's Aliecrono Scythe.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.390
The Dolueli Swordscale.

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:55.910
And this, the Elemio Comb.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.650
As I just demonstrated,

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:02.030
it holds a divine power which nullifies magic.

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:04.000
Three relics.

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:07.410
Retreat. We don't stand a chance like this.

00:14:09.060 --> 00:14:09.930
Ryner.

00:14:09.930 --> 00:14:11.520
I know!

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:12.910
I won't let you escape.

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:17.120
Resonate!

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:20.590
Ryner?

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.410
Hey, Ryner! What's wrong?

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:31.950
You want it.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:34.680
You want everything to dissapear.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.610
What did you do to Ryner?

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:41.790
If I don't awaken the Alpha Stigma, it can't be stolen.

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:42.930
Awaken?

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:44.900
There's no way you couldn't know.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:48.660
The reason the Alpha Stigma is a hated taboo...

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:51.070
It goes out of control, and destroys everything.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:57.420
That's why people call them mad devils, despicable slaughterers.

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:01.880
Nothing matters...

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:03.170
I...

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:07.760
No... I...

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:12.890
They're monsters whose very existence causes trouble.

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:13.560
Ryner!

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:29.190
It doesn't matter...

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:34.060
Ferris... Run...

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:37.290
Get away... from me...

00:15:38.300 --> 00:15:39.170
Ryner?

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:46.970
Don't... look...

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:52.050
...at me... like this...

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:55.560
A monster... I don't want...

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:00.890
...to kill... you...

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:07.820
People die. But none of it matters to you. Now, let us end it.

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:11.070
Stop!

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:18.580
Everything. Yours to toy with. Release it. Open up. Kill. Everything.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:30.780
Collapse of the bearer confirmed. It's awakened.

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:32.970
What the hell did you do to Ryner?!

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:38.750
Now all he'll do is run wild and rain down destruction.

00:16:38.750 --> 00:16:43.320
We'll kill him before that, though, and gouge out his crystal.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:51.590
That won't work. Didn't I just show you?

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:56.890
This Elemio Comb has divine powers. It nullifies all of your power!

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:03.620
Analyse existence. Release. Begone, you worm.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:06.840
What the hell?

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:20.560
Burn him!

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.860
Brother Sui. Are you alive?

00:17:29.950 --> 00:17:31.110
Y-Yeah.

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:37.420
What is this thing?

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:40.570
He's not an ordinary Alpha Stigma bearer?

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:45.130
You would kill me? With your power?

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:49.090
You claim Elemio's paltry power would kill me?

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:50.550
Ryner...

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:52.770
Little worms, crawling in your holes.

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:57.610
Begone, begone, begone.

00:17:57.740 --> 00:18:00.680
Everything is nothing. Return to nothingness!

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:10.380
We need to run, Kuu. That's not an Alpha Stigma!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:24.690
Ryner!

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:31.760
Run where you will. Everything will return to nothingness.

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:33.810
First comes destruction!

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:38.180
I bring forth nothing. I bless nothing. I save nothing.

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:42.100
I just erase. Completely.

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:52.870
Aren't you lonely living here by yourself, Ryner?

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:55.070
Not really, I have all of you.

00:18:57.030 --> 00:19:00.490
I'll become your mom, Ryner!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:03.770
From now on, call me Mom.

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:06.010
Okay, then I'll be the dad!

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:09.780
I don't wanna be husband and wife with Dell!

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:11.870
Ouch, I've been dumped!

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:16.290
Run!

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:18.090
Hurry, run for it!

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:22.510
Filthy corpse looters! Hand over everything you've stolen!

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:35.440
W-We can't. If we did that, we'd be...

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:40.480
Please, give me my daughter back!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.380
Give Quill back!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.470
What I seek is the burning field. Kurenai!

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:12.690
Damn. You'll all defy us?

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.730
Mom! Mom!
Damn. You'll all defy us?

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:16.690
Please, stop!

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:17.640
I beg of you...

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:21.820
What I seek is the burning field. Kurenai!

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.060
Just know, that was...

00:20:29.060 --> 00:20:31.210
That kid... His eyes!

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:38.760
Quill...

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:43.870
It's an Alpha Stigma bearer!

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:46.780
It's a monster. A monster!

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:54.120
Quill?

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:01.330
Monster...

00:21:02.390 --> 00:21:03.990
Alpha Stigma...

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:06.990
That bastard Talrom. Why'd he bring a brat like this here?

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:09.040
Was he deceiving us?!

00:21:10.210 --> 00:21:11.720
How terrifying!

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:14.520
A monster... He's a monster!

00:21:14.520 --> 00:21:16.410
Die, monster!

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:19.450
Monster...

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.810
I see, I'm...

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:44.150
I'm...

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:49.210
...a monster.

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:23.650
<i>This sucks.</i>

00:23:23.650 --> 00:23:25.870
<i>Everything sucks, all of it.</i>

00:23:26.470 --> 00:23:31.210
<i>Didn't I say that all I wanted was to enjoy afternoon naps?</i>

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:32.630
<i>Yet...</i>

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:35.260
<i>Why is the world so...?</i>
